@#==============================================================
#
#  Name: RELEASE_NOTES
#
#  Rem:  This files describes release notes for 
#        the SPEAR RF IOC Application.        
#
#--------------------------------------------------------------
#
#
Note: RF-SPEAR must be built on solaris to use vxWorks 5.4
installed at SLAC.  Since no solaris machine has access to
spear NFS, the release must be checked out and built in AFS 
space and then move to NFS space on a spear linux machine.

RF-SPEAR-R0-3-2: 15-Sept-2020
    * More alarm limit changes 
      - Make permanent the temporary changes by J.Sebek to  
	    Klystron window air inlet alarm limits changes for the new klystron
    * Force tagged on 25-Jan-2021
            SRF1:FILAMENT:TIME changed from 1600 to 2100 seconds by J.Sebek for the new RF klystron.
	    Updated the HOPR and HIHI limits accordingly in rf_klys.db.
    * Force tagged on 29-Jun-2021
            SRF1:STNAMBAIR:TEMP.HIGH changed from 42 to 28
	    SRF1:CAV3IONP:TEMP.HIGH changed from 401 to 26	
		
RF-SPEAR-R0-3-1: 12-Sept-2020
    * CATER Id:	146329	    Job Number:	5
      - Make permanent the temporary changes by J.Sebek to Solenoid bucking coil 
	    current and voltage alarm limits changes for the new klystron
	* 18-Oct-2018: Changed limit per SPEAR3 elog entry 961133	
	  - Commit changes made in production in 2018 to CVS

RF-SPEAR-R0-3-0: 01/04/2017
    * CATER Id: 	134001	    Job Number:	1
	    - Add seq record to stop&init all 4 cavity tuners.
    * Undo changes in previous release - C and D swapped back.
RF-SPEAR-R0-2-0: 10/03/2016
    * CATER Id: 	133802	    Job Number:	1
	    - SW change due to tuner connectors C and D being swapped 
RF-SPEAR-R0-1-0: 10/03/2016
	* iocStats-R3-1-12 upgrade.
	* Increase Window temp HIGH.
	* Correct crate location.
	* Add base routines.
	* Change klystron IP current to nA and changed scaling and alarm limits.  
RF-SPEAR-R0-0-3: 7/13/2014
	* Calculate alarm limits for magic T post temp based on ambient.
	* Increase precision and decrease MDEL for klystron gain and efficiency.
	* Reduced HCW temp low alarm limits.
	* Remove ripple loop gain tracking severity from the feedback severity sum.

RF-SPEAR-R0-0-2: 3/13/2013
	* Change low warning limit on HCW temps.
	* Add separate low limit on load angle offset.

RF-SPEAR-R0-0-1: 10/3/2012
	Remove dependency on epics/site:
	* Move epvxi, allenBradley, and stepper from epics/site to here.
	* Use restore in epics/modules instead of epics/site.

RF-SPEAR-R0-0-0: 9/18/2012
	* Initial Release

